C2. The MFPI (Multi‑Function Particle Instrument) combined diode‑SNN particle flux classifier, with a closed‑form bound on detection latency and empirical validation of event‑typing precision.

C3. A closed‑form thermal‑radiation coupled drift variance model for HfO₂ RRAM, derived from oxygen‑vacancy kinetics, together with a theorem on the magnification of drift variance under multiplicative coupling.

C4. The MPNV (Magnetic Pulse Neural Verification) thermal‑aware recalibration protocol with stuck‑at fault detection and dynamic cell remapping via crossbar redundancy rows, supported by a convergence theorem.

