· GUARD → GUARD⁺: SNN classifies event as SEP with $\Delta t_{\text{SEP}} > T_{B,\text{safe}}$.
· GUARD⁺ → FORTRESS: $\hat\Phi(t)$ exceeds Domain C safety margin.
· All reverse transitions occur when flux subsides and thermal conditions allow.

